{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Great sea-creatures.</b> The great fish of the sea. And in aggadic teaching, this is Leviathan and its mate — He created them male and female and killed the female and salted her for the righteous in the time to come, for if they multiplied and increased the world could not endure them." "<b>Soul of the living creature.</b> That which has life in it."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:07.615413762Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}